		"description": "When the wrath of Arkath, the Dragon God of Fire, grows strong enough to pierce the barrier between the elemental plane of Fire and the world of Ashan, fiery Fire Elementals spring from the elemental surge that this wrath creates. Most of them arise in spontaneous forest fires; others come from great lava flows or volcanic eruptions. Fire Elementals born deep in Ashan's crust near the gates of Sheogh are less stable and often tainted by the influence of Urgash, the Dragon of Chaos; yet Fire Elementals also arise in the hearths of families devoted to Arkath, or in braziers lit by the prayers of dwarven rune priests. Dwarven smiths often summon Fire Elementals to help them forge legendary weapons and armor.",
