	"h6NeutralMermaid": {
		"name": {
			"singular": "Mermaid",
			"plural": "Mermaids"
		},
		"description": "In 512 YSD the wizards of the Seven Cities began creating beast-men to serve as guards, servants and \"playthings\". The Mermaids, half human and half dolphin, were first made to guard, patrol and sail the mages' coasts; unfortunately the land of the wizards lies in the desert, so few Mermaids ever saw water, and most of them ended up as pets their masters showed off to astonished guests. So although the Mermaids took little part in the Orc Rebellion, they were very glad to slip quietly away in its aftermath. Since then they have lived in the sea, enjoying a measure of freedom, with few natural enemies and even less attention. Only one thing they cannot forget: their hatred of the wizards and their distrust of every creature of the land. Only the Naga and the wisest, most respected captains can hope that these fickle, dangerous creatures will squeeze out a drop of goodwill.",
